{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-01-ethics-for-engineers-artificial-in_calendar","fact_refs":[0,1],"question":"Who taught MIT's 10.01 Ethics for Engineers: Artificial Intelligence course and in what term was it offered?","answer":"Prof. Bernhardt Trout and Daniel Doneson taught the course, which was offered as an undergraduate course in Spring 2020."}
